<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head', { title: 'DevToolkit — Developer Utilities' }) %>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="dashboard-container">
    <%- include('partials/header', { pill: 'DEVTOOLKIT', h1Left: 'Build faster with', h1Right: 'focused tools', subtitle: 'Process one file, many files, or entire folders with a consistent workflow built for developers.' }) %>

    <div class="enterprise-note">
      <strong>Privacy:</strong> web tools upload files to this server temporarily for processing. Uploaded job files are automatically cleaned up after processing. Browser-only tools will be labeled separately when added.
    </div>

    <div class="dashboard" aria-label="Developer tools">
      <a href="/php-protector" class="tool-card">
        <span class="tag">Security</span>
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🛡️</div>
        <h2>PHP Protector</h2>
        <p>Obfuscate PHP projects recursively while preserving project structure. Intended as basic source obfuscation, not encryption.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/image-resizer" class="tool-card">
        <span class="tag">Images</span>
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">📐</div>
        <h2>Image Resizer</h2>
        <p>Resize individual images or whole folders with Cover, Contain, Inside, and smart fitting options.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/image-converter" class="tool-card">
        <span class="tag">Images</span>
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🔄</div>
        <h2>Image Converter</h2>
        <p>Convert batches between WebP, JPEG, PNG, AVIF, TIFF, and other supported formats.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/image-compressor" class="tool-card">
        <span class="tag">Images</span>
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🗜️</div>
        <h2>Image Compressor</h2>
        <p>Compress one image, multiple images, or folder structures with quality presets and metadata controls.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/pdf-compressor" class="tool-card">
        <span class="tag">PDF</span>
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">📄</div>
        <h2>PDF Compressor</h2>
        <p>Reduce PDF size using guarded Ghostscript presets with support for multi-file and folder workflows.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/file-renamer" class="tool-card">
        <span class="tag">Files</span>
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🏷️</div>
        <h2>Smart File Renamer</h2>
        <p>Standardize filenames in bulk with casing, separators, cleanup rules, patterns, and grouping options.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/code-minifier" class="tool-card">
        <span class="tag">Code</span>
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">⚡</div>
        <h2>Code Minifier</h2>
        <p>Minify HTML, CSS, and JavaScript individually or across a complete project while preserving other files.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="toast-container" id="toast-container"></div>
  <script src="/js/toast.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/theme.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/shortcuts.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/cmd-palette.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/settings.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/tour.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
